        <div class="drivers">Economic deterioration from Hormuz closure and war expenditure is documented in IRNA's own reporting on ration subsidies. IRGC is the primary domestic order-maintenance force; IranWire's September 24 reporting on hardliner backlash to UNGA diplomacy is consistent with IRGC-civilian friction remaining high. No popular uprising indicators observed week of Sep 22–29.</div>
      </div>

