        <div class="drivers">Netanyahu is caretaker PM through the October 27 election; his probability of stepping down is closely tied to F10 (mandate) and F5 (plurality). If Eisenkot's bloc wins the mandate from Herzog, Netanyahu steps down as a consequence of the constitutional process — raising the high end of the range. Channel 12 polling (Yashar 23, Likud 20) keeps the 50% tail live.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

